{
  "_doc": [
    "Kontrat vektorleri (docs/DESIGN_SUPABASE.md 3.6). HEM SQL testi (supabase/tests/01, 02) HEM UE native testi (sahte ulasim) AYNI dosyayi okur.",
    "Dosya ASCII'dir; ASCII disi karakterler \\uXXXX ile yazilir. Durum: GECICI VARSAYIM (mimari C), hicbir gercek DB'ye karsi calistirilmadi.",
    "canonical_key[]: ad -> beklenen anahtar. ue_canonical_key = MMONameRules::CanonicalKey(name); ue_is_reserved = MMONameRules::IsReservedName(name). db_key = SQL mmo.canonical_key(name), null = DB adi REDDEDER (bad_name). db_reserved = mmo.is_reserved_key(db_key) (create/import reserved_name doner). Kural: db_key null degilse db_key == ue_canonical_key. UE, ASCII disi adi KIRPAR (Omer -> mer), DB REDDEDER.",
    "scenarios[]: sirali adimlar. {rpc, args, expect[, exact]} bir RPC cagrisi: sonuc, expect'i kapsamali (jsonb @>; exact=true ise tam esit). {admin:'expire_lease', key} kiranin suresini doldurur (SQL harness: lease_until gecmise; UE sahtesi: sahte saati ilerletir).",
    "args/expect degerlerinde '@isim' = fixtures[isim] (jsonb). Her sonuc: outcome alani + RPC'ye ozgu alanlar. HTTP her zaman 200; yalniz altyapi arizasi HTTP hatasidir.",
    "Senaryolar birbirinden bagimsiz anahtarlar (zz-v-*) ve benzersiz op_id kullanir; bir veritabaninda sirayla kosulabilir. Sure olcmeye bagli adim yok (kira suresi admin adimiyla)."
  ],
  "contract_version": 1,

  "outcomes": [
    "ok", "committed", "imported", "already_imported", "not_found", "already_exists", "invalid",
    "revision_conflict", "ownership_lost", "idempotency_conflict", "conflict", "internal"
  ],

  "limits": {
    "name_max_len": 32,
    "key_regex": "^[a-z0-9_-]{1,32}$",
    "name_regex": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]([A-Za-z0-9 _-]{0,30}[A-Za-z0-9_-])?$",
    "data_max_octets": 2097152,
    "side_value_max_octets": 262144,
    "lease_ttl_min_s": 10,
    "lease_ttl_max_s": 600,
    "lease_ttl_default_s": 120,
    "list_keys_max": 500,
    "list_keys_default": 100
  },

  "rpc_params": {
    "healthcheck": [],
    "load_character": ["p_key"],
    "character_exists": ["p_key"],
    "list_keys": ["p_prefix", "p_limit"],
    "create_character": ["p_key", "p_display_name", "p_holder", "p_op_id", "p_schema_version", "p_data", "p_race"],
    "acquire_lease": ["p_key", "p_holder", "p_ttl_s"],
    "renew_lease": ["p_key", "p_holder", "p_epoch", "p_ttl_s"],
    "release_lease": ["p_key", "p_holder", "p_epoch"],
    "save_character": ["p_key", "p_holder", "p_epoch", "p_expected_revision", "p_op_id", "p_schema_version", "p_data", "p_side"],
    "get_op": ["p_op_id"],
    "import_character": ["p_key", "p_display_name", "p_source_sha256", "p_schema_version", "p_data", "p_race"]
  },

  "fixtures": {
    "envelope_a": { "SchemaVersion": 2, "Data": { "Level": 1, "Experience": 0, "Gold": 100, "NextInstanceId": 1 } },
    "envelope_b": { "SchemaVersion": 2, "Data": { "Level": 2, "Experience": 50, "Gold": 150, "NextInstanceId": 2 } },
    "envelope_c": { "SchemaVersion": 2, "Data": { "Level": 3, "Experience": 90, "Gold": 175, "NextInstanceId": 3 } },
    "envelope_bad_gold": { "SchemaVersion": 2, "Data": { "Level": 1, "Experience": 0, "Gold": -1, "NextInstanceId": 1 } },
    "envelope_bad_level": { "SchemaVersion": 2, "Data": { "Level": 0, "Experience": 0, "Gold": 0, "NextInstanceId": 1 } },
    "envelope_version_mismatch": { "SchemaVersion": 1, "Data": { "Level": 1, "Experience": 0, "Gold": 0, "NextInstanceId": 1 } },
    "side_ok": { "achievements": { "unlocked": ["first_kill"] }, "daily": { "day": "2026-10-17" } },
    "side_bad_kind": { "inventory": {} }
  },

  "canonical_key": [
